WEBVTT

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:12.340
"Kodomo no Omocha"

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.620
Both today and tomorrow, I've got time to kick back.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
My family of four and I are going to stay the night.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
Put on an Egyptian front and become a sphinx,

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
and for an American feeling, Texas!

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
When you're sitting pretty, with enough and to spare,

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
and yet you always shilly-shally,

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.890
and your bitter face and bitter
feelings both teeter-totter,

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.350
it's time to get out of there!

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.690
I am feeling Ultra Relax,

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.900
a wonderful, invincible Relax.

00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:52.940
A one-step-above kind of Deluxe.

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:55.860
I may be a little jumbled,
but when I'm called on, ba-ba-ba-ba-bang!

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:58.910
I always feel Relax,

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.910
a humble, simple, sort of Deluxe.

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
Bright! Clear! Alert-headed, peep-peep!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.960
Keep your eyes on me, okay!?

00:01:33.030 --> 00:01:36.700
I'm Kurata Sana, a 6th grader
and TV personality.

00:01:36.700 --> 00:01:40.030
My Aoki award-winning novelist Mama,
and her chipmunk, Maro-chan.

00:01:40.030 --> 00:01:43.040
My chauffeur, manager,
and ex-pimp, Rei-kun.

00:01:43.040 --> 00:01:45.040
The mysterious white bat
straight man, Babbit.

00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:46.710
My ears are huge.

00:01:46.710 --> 00:01:49.710
Hayama Akito, my natural enemy
and good friend, I suppose.

00:01:49.710 --> 00:01:53.300
The man who I declared was my boyfriend,
Take-chan, a.k.a. Gojo Takeshi-san.

00:01:56.380 --> 00:02:00.260
It always ends up like this. Always.

00:02:01.390 --> 00:02:03.310
It always has.

00:02:05.390 --> 00:02:07.850
Call it ill fortune if you like...

00:02:09.270 --> 00:02:14.780
I've never seen anything
through to the end.

00:02:16.740 --> 00:02:18.530
This is no time for the past
to be bugging you,

00:02:18.530 --> 00:02:21.410
and turning you into a bug, Take-chan!

00:02:21.410 --> 00:02:25.160
What's important is the present!
Not to mention the future!

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:32.340
There's something that's
gotten me a bit down, you see...

00:02:32.340 --> 00:02:35.000
So it seems.

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:38.340
Maybe I'll stay here with you, Take-chan,
for the rest of my life.

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:39.380
Sure.

00:02:41.340 --> 00:02:44.010
I think I should go home.

00:02:45.350 --> 00:02:50.020
I mean, my insides were feeling
all tight and stiff, you know?

00:02:50.020 --> 00:02:54.360
But then it seemed like, suddenly,
all of that melted right away.

00:02:54.360 --> 00:02:58.650
When I thought about spending
the rest of my life with you, Take-chan,

00:02:58.650 --> 00:03:00.700
that's what suddenly happened.

00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:03.030
You really are amazing.

00:03:04.370 --> 00:03:06.990
You're going to go back, all on your own.

00:03:06.990 --> 00:03:10.040
You're going to go back,
all under your own strength.

00:03:10.040 --> 00:03:15.040
Back when I ran away before,
I couldn't come back on my own.

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:17.670
That was all your strength then, too.

00:03:19.380 --> 00:03:24.390
This man Gojo- he may be
someone that Sana needs.

00:03:24.720 --> 00:03:29.730
I see... So Gojo-san lived here
up until thirteen years ago, then?

00:03:30.390 --> 00:03:34.020
Now, do you know the name of the woman
who he was seeing at that time?

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:38.690
Her first name was Keiko...
yes, she was named Keiko-san.

00:03:38.690 --> 00:03:40.360
Keiko?

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:41.360
Who are you?

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:46.030
It's about this Gojo-san that Sana-chan
has announced as being her boyfriend.

00:03:46.030 --> 00:03:49.040
I've discovered that they do in fact
have a very interesting relationship.

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:50.540
W- what did you say!?

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:56.340
W- what did he say!?

00:03:56.340 --> 00:04:01.300
Gojo Takeshi is... Sana's true father?

00:04:04.390 --> 00:04:07.760
"Father, You Are My Father"

00:04:13.060 --> 00:04:15.400
Aww, the house is so new,
and look what you've done already.

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:17.360
It wasn't my fault!

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:19.650
Yes!

00:04:21.030 --> 00:04:23.030
Oh well. Yes, yes, yes!

00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:24.530
This house is put together
more cheaply than I expected.

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:32.330
"Discretion is the better part of valor"
"Evil Spirits Away"

00:04:26.740 --> 00:04:28.740
Oh, what a peculiar little room!

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:33.000
It's an elevator. I will listen to the
rest of what you have to say downstairs.

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:34.210
You've got lousy taste.

00:04:34.210 --> 00:04:36.130
"Sana comes home"
"Sana finally, finally comes home"

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:40.170
--If you please!
--Yes, who is it?

00:04:40.170 --> 00:04:44.680
This house strictly turns away all peddlers,
salesmen, and drifters.

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:48.350
I'm not a drifter! It's me!
Sana! Hurry and open up!

00:04:48.350 --> 00:04:50.010
This is Sana-chan's new house, right?

00:04:50.010 --> 00:04:51.680
Maybe.

00:04:51.680 --> 00:04:55.350
Enough with the lame jokes!
Hurry and let me in, Rei-kun!

00:04:55.350 --> 00:04:58.020
Then again, can you prove
to me that you are Sana-chan?

00:04:56.350 --> 00:04:57.810
"Not very nice!!"

00:04:58.020 --> 00:04:59.690
Proof, you say? All right...

00:04:59.690 --> 00:05:00.690
If that's what you want,

00:05:00.690 --> 00:05:03.690
allow me to tell you some secrets
about Rei-kun that only Sana would know!

00:05:03.690 --> 00:05:05.070
Click...

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:10.620
♪ Rei-kun is being mean,
he's being very mean, ♪

00:05:10.620 --> 00:05:14.290
♪ and if that's how he wants it,
I'll expose his secrets, hey! ♪

00:05:14.290 --> 00:05:18.290
♪ He loves, loves,
really loves Asako-san, ♪

00:05:18.290 --> 00:05:21.460
♪ and always sleeps
holding an Asako dolly. ♪

00:05:22.300 --> 00:05:26.970
Yes, step right up and see for yourself,
here are the pictures that prove it!

00:05:25.340 --> 00:05:25.550
"Rei-kun's Scandals First Public Exhibition"

00:05:26.970 --> 00:05:29.300
All right, Sana-chan! Stop, already!

00:05:29.300 --> 00:05:32.270
Sorry for the commotion, everyone!
Please excuse us!

00:05:32.270 --> 00:05:33.270
Ah, Sana-chan!

00:05:33.270 --> 00:05:34.930
Shimura-san!

00:05:34.930 --> 00:05:36.600
Ah, I've missed you, Shimura-san!

00:05:36.600 --> 00:05:38.600
I've missed you too, Sana-chan.

00:05:38.600 --> 00:05:40.610
Oh, yeah, where's Mama?

00:05:40.610 --> 00:05:42.610
I think she's in her study.

00:05:42.610 --> 00:05:44.610
Mama, I'm home! Huh?

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:46.950
There's some dense growth in here,
but no Mama.

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:48.950
That's odd.

00:05:48.950 --> 00:05:53.620
This is the apartment that Gojo Takeshi
was renting twelve years ago.

00:05:53.620 --> 00:05:57.290
At the time, there was a woman
that Gojo Takeshi was seeing.

00:05:57.290 --> 00:06:01.630
And there is no question that the one
who Gojo-san was seeing was...

00:06:01.630 --> 00:06:03.630
--...this woman.
--Keiko-san!

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:07.970
Yes. Sakai Keiko, Sana-chan's true mother.

00:06:07.970 --> 00:06:10.970
Twelve years ago? That means...

00:06:10.970 --> 00:06:13.970
That is correct, Sensei.

00:06:13.970 --> 00:06:18.640
Gojo Takeshi is... Sana's true father...

00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:21.650
So... this is my new room?

00:06:21.650 --> 00:06:25.990
Wow! It's been so long since
I had one so big! Rumble-bumpers!

00:06:25.990 --> 00:06:28.200
--Hoy! This is my new bed!
--We'll be gradually adding
everything you need.

00:06:31.240 --> 00:06:33.240
We're getting off in the doghouse?

00:06:33.240 --> 00:06:37.910
Now, get out of here at once,
before Sana realizes you're here.

00:06:37.910 --> 00:06:40.250
I will need to be well remunerated.

00:06:40.250 --> 00:06:42.920
I will contact you
once I have final confirmation.

00:06:43.040 --> 00:06:45.460
"Final confirmation?"

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:45.300
What's final confirmation?

00:06:49.260 --> 00:06:50.260
Yes?

00:06:50.260 --> 00:06:52.260
Hello!

00:06:52.260 --> 00:06:54.720
It's been a long time, huh Keiko-san?

00:06:57.270 --> 00:06:58.600
Good morning!

00:06:58.600 --> 00:06:59.940
Good morning, Sana-chan.

00:06:59.940 --> 00:07:02.270
Sana-chan, how is it living
in your new house?

00:07:02.270 --> 00:07:04.940
Man, maybe it's because I haven't
slept in a big room for so long,

00:07:04.940 --> 00:07:07.280
but I was so happy, I tossed,
and I turned, and I even somersaulted!

00:07:07.280 --> 00:07:09.950
Wow, Sana-chan, you sure are nimble.

00:07:09.950 --> 00:07:12.950
And my work is humming along, too.
It feels like I could do anything!

00:07:12.950 --> 00:07:14.490
Oh, I read something,

00:07:14.490 --> 00:07:16.620
about your appearances in
"Chaos Theater" being increased.

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:19.040
Heh heh heh, thanks to
Take-chan's great style.

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:20.960
Starting today, there'll be a
new development on location.

00:07:21.960 --> 00:07:26.300
Say, Akito-kun, about what you
said before, what did you mean?

00:07:26.300 --> 00:07:28.630
They're like...

00:07:28.630 --> 00:07:30.970
...father and daughter, aren't they?

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:33.890
Nothing. At the time,
that's just what occurred to me.

00:07:33.890 --> 00:07:36.510
Oh, Akito-kun, so you didn't
mean anything deeper!

00:07:36.510 --> 00:07:38.270
I thought about it as hard as I could.

00:07:38.270 --> 00:07:39.930
I thought about it,
but didn't understand you.

00:07:39.930 --> 00:07:41.600
I wasn't supposed to understand, though,

00:07:41.600 --> 00:07:43.900
because it was just something
off the top of your head!

00:07:43.900 --> 00:07:45.310
Damn, you're annoying.

00:07:46.570 --> 00:07:48.190
"But these two are bothered"

00:07:46.940 --> 00:07:48.070
Speaking of being bothered...

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:52.910
She said it was okay for me to leave,
but this is so irregular for her.

00:07:52.910 --> 00:07:56.160
Sensei never goes
into coffee shops by herself.

00:07:58.290 --> 00:08:00.960
Who in the world could she be waiting for?

00:08:00.960 --> 00:08:02.250
All right! It's over!

00:08:02.250 --> 00:08:04.920
I'm going to work with Take-chan!

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:07.290
Thanks for waiting, Rei-kun!

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:09.300
Huh? He's not here yet!

00:08:09.300 --> 00:08:14.260
Sana-chan, it's time! Sana-chan,
it's time! Sana-chan, it's time!

00:08:14.930 --> 00:08:16.600
Thinking back to this morning...

00:08:16.600 --> 00:08:20.270
Sana-chan, you're so forgetful,
so I'll set your timer, okay?

00:08:20.270 --> 00:08:21.980
Sana-chan, it's time!

00:08:21.980 --> 00:08:23.270
There, okay.

00:08:23.310 --> 00:08:26.520
That dummy has the nerve to
call me forgetful!? That jerk!

00:08:28.320 --> 00:08:29.610
O- okay, Sana-chan, I'm coming!

00:08:29.610 --> 00:08:30.610
Ka-ching!

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:33.900
Good morning!

00:08:33.900 --> 00:08:35.240
I'm sorry we're late.

00:08:35.240 --> 00:08:37.240
Nah, you're the first one here, Sana-chan.

00:08:37.240 --> 00:08:40.240
Huh? First one here?
Take-chan hasn't shown up yet?

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:44.250
Mm-hmm, and here I brought
a nice offer for Gojo-kun, too.

00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:45.920
Huh? What's the nice offer?

00:08:45.920 --> 00:08:47.130
I was thinking of offering him

00:08:47.130 --> 00:08:50.250
the co-starring role in
a new Golden Drama in April.

00:08:50.250 --> 00:08:51.920
Eh!? A co-starring role!?

00:08:51.920 --> 00:08:53.920
Mm-hmm, I think he'll be a hit.

00:08:53.920 --> 00:08:57.260
His unaffected style is
something uniquely his.

00:08:57.260 --> 00:09:00.600
Oh, that's terrific!
That's a big promotion, isn't it!?

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:02.930
Take-chan will be
twirling the mambo of joy!

00:09:02.930 --> 00:09:04.600
But won't that be asking too much of him?

00:09:04.600 --> 00:09:05.600
Huh? Why?

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:07.940
As sloppy with being on time as he is?

00:09:07.940 --> 00:09:10.230
Ah! That's not so! It's okay!

00:09:10.230 --> 00:09:13.280
Take-chan loves to surprise people,
so he might really already be here!

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:15.280
See? Over there!

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:18.280
See? What if that's Take-chan
asleep over there?

00:09:18.280 --> 00:09:21.870
Well, I don't have anymore time today,
so I'll be leaving. I'll contact you later.

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:25.960
Oh, Sana-chan, your performance
is also really good.

00:09:25.960 --> 00:09:29.090
I have a hunch that some blockbuster work
will be coming to you before long.

00:09:29.090 --> 00:09:31.130
Films and so forth. Bye now.

00:09:34.550 --> 00:09:36.220
And here he could have watched
Take-chan's dance of joy

00:09:36.220 --> 00:09:37.220
while he was here.

00:09:37.220 --> 00:09:39.970
I should have given Take-chan a Burutcha.

00:09:46.560 --> 00:09:48.400
I'm sorry I'm late.

00:09:52.230 --> 00:09:53.570
Surprised you?

00:09:53.570 --> 00:09:54.900
That was in bad taste.

00:09:54.900 --> 00:09:55.900
Take-chan!

00:09:55.900 --> 00:09:57.780
It really was you, Take-chan!

00:09:57.780 --> 00:10:00.240
Congratulations, Take-chan,
you're getting a big promotion!

00:10:00.240 --> 00:10:01.910
What big promotion is that?

00:10:01.910 --> 00:10:04.580
Huh? You didn't hear what
we were just talking about?

00:10:04.580 --> 00:10:06.660
Ups-a-daisy...

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:10.920
T- Take-chan!

00:10:10.920 --> 00:10:12.590
Just a little dizzy...

00:10:12.590 --> 00:10:17.590
Take-chan, you look pale! Are you okay?
You're not seriously ill, right?

00:10:17.590 --> 00:10:22.260
I'm all right. I'm sure it's
because I haven't eaten.

00:10:22.260 --> 00:10:25.930
Whew, thank goodness. I leave you alone,
and right away, this happens to you!

00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:28.270
Take-san, are you okay? We're starting!

00:10:28.270 --> 00:10:30.480
Yes! Sing-ken-ken ken-ken!

00:10:31.560 --> 00:10:33.320
"Elsewhere, at that moment..."

00:10:34.900 --> 00:10:39.910
Forgive me, Keiko-san. I know
that you have your own life now.

00:10:41.910 --> 00:10:46.910
I just wanted to find out the truth.
Please answer me, yes or no.

00:10:47.580 --> 00:10:50.830
Gojo-san is Sana's father, isn't he?

00:10:58.920 --> 00:11:03.930
He suddenly disappeared,
without even saying goodbye.

00:11:04.260 --> 00:11:09.140
I didn't know where he had gone,
and thought that he had passed away.

00:11:09.140 --> 00:11:10.600
But then...

00:11:10.600 --> 00:11:14.610
...his name started
coming up in the media...

00:11:14.610 --> 00:11:16.940
...and I...

00:11:16.940 --> 00:11:18.940
I...

00:11:18.940 --> 00:11:23.280
I don't know how many times
I wanted to call you, Sensei...

00:11:23.280 --> 00:11:25.620
Thank you, Keiko-san.

00:11:25.620 --> 00:11:29.620
That's enough. It's all
in the past for you now.

00:11:29.620 --> 00:11:32.630
I really am sorry for this.

00:11:39.300 --> 00:11:40.300
This is a problem.

00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:43.300
Indeed it is. This is a serious development.

00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:46.350
Oh, this is a problem.
Where is my house again?

00:11:46.350 --> 00:11:47.640
You've gotten yourself lost!?

00:11:47.640 --> 00:11:49.640
I know! I'll call him!

00:11:49.640 --> 00:11:50.640
Him?

00:11:50.640 --> 00:11:51.640
"Ribbon Books"

00:11:51.640 --> 00:11:54.400
Sensei!

00:11:56.650 --> 00:11:57.980
Your manuscript?

00:11:57.980 --> 00:12:01.990
That comes later! Now, head
for my house, and let's go!

00:12:01.990 --> 00:12:04.660
--You're using me as a car?
--That's right!

00:12:04.660 --> 00:12:06.700
Onda-san has a Burutcha, too.

00:12:07.990 --> 00:12:10.000
What to do, what to do?

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:13.000
--Should I tell her the truth, after all?
--I'm home!

00:12:13.000 --> 00:12:15.000
Come on, Take-chan,
don't be shy, come on in!

00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:16.340
Take-chan?

00:12:16.340 --> 00:12:17.670
Excuse the intrusion!

00:12:17.670 --> 00:12:20.010
Take-chan, your room is next to mine.

00:12:20.010 --> 00:12:24.010
Ah, Mama, this is Gojo Takeshi-san.
He's my rumored boyfriend right now.

00:12:24.010 --> 00:12:25.720
Gojo. Pleased to meet you.

00:12:29.010 --> 00:12:30.680
He's got lousy taste.

00:12:30.680 --> 00:12:35.270
Pleased to meet you. I'm Sana's mother.
Thank you for looking after my daughter.

00:12:35.270 --> 00:12:38.940
It embarrasses me to admit this, but I've
come here today to be looked after myself.

00:12:38.940 --> 00:12:42.490
Take-chan lives by himself, you see,
and doesn't eat decently,

00:12:42.490 --> 00:12:43.950
so he's ruined his health.

00:12:43.950 --> 00:12:46.160
Keeping irregular hours like
he does isn't good for him,

00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:48.950
so I invited him to come
live here for a while.

00:12:49.950 --> 00:12:51.620
S- Sagami...

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:53.290
--What is the meaning of this?
--Come on, Take-chan, hurry, hurry.

00:12:53.290 --> 00:12:55.960
--I'm sorry, Sana-chan insisted.
--Okay, pardon my intrusion!

00:12:55.960 --> 00:12:58.960
Shimura-san, make some
yummy food for him, okay?

00:12:58.960 --> 00:13:02.380
You know, that old man has a lot of nerve!

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:04.680
Wait just a minute.

00:13:05.630 --> 00:13:07.140
Wait just a minute.

00:13:09.310 --> 00:13:12.060
"Etunim a tsuj tiaw." What was that?

00:13:15.060 --> 00:13:17.770
It was "Wait just a minute"!

00:13:19.060 --> 00:13:20.070
Wait just a minute.

00:13:20.070 --> 00:13:24.070
Go on, Sensei, please tell them sternly
that they can't do this! Sternly!

00:13:24.070 --> 00:13:25.400
Wait just a minute!

00:13:25.400 --> 00:13:27.740
We have been waiting for a while now.

00:13:27.740 --> 00:13:29.740
Yes, you are waiting, aren't you?

00:13:29.740 --> 00:13:33.700
The truth is, Misako-san is trying
to think of what to say next.

00:13:33.700 --> 00:13:34.710
Gojo-san...

00:13:34.710 --> 00:13:35.710
Yes?

00:13:35.710 --> 00:13:36.710
Sana...

00:13:36.710 --> 00:13:39.040
What?

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:41.840
You two are... you two are...

00:13:43.050 --> 00:13:45.380
...getting along well, huh?

00:13:45.380 --> 00:13:48.390
Oh, Mama, you're telling us
something we already know quite well.

00:13:48.390 --> 00:13:52.720
You don't say. Perhaps you'd like to
take the personality assessment test?

00:13:52.720 --> 00:13:54.770
Gojo Gojo-san, do you think
that Martina Hingis

00:13:54.770 --> 00:13:56.730
can win it all at Wimbledon?

00:13:56.730 --> 00:13:58.020
Who's that, now?

00:13:58.060 --> 00:14:00.690
What will be the next high school girl
fad item after loose socks?

00:14:00.690 --> 00:14:02.730
Monpe pants, maybe?

00:14:02.730 --> 00:14:06.030
Oh my, his fatherly characteristics
are a perfect match to Sana.

00:14:06.030 --> 00:14:08.030
That much is pretty obvious,
huh Take-chan?

00:14:08.070 --> 00:14:10.370
Sensei, please, be strong!

00:14:10.370 --> 00:14:12.580
"Sure enough, she couldn't tell them"

00:14:10.370 --> 00:14:12.530
Usually, she would have gone up the stairs.

00:14:13.080 --> 00:14:15.040
There you go...

00:14:15.040 --> 00:14:17.040
Okay, Take-chan, sleep here for tonight.

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:18.710
We'll get all the other things
for you together later.

00:14:18.710 --> 00:14:19.710
Thank you, Sana-chan.

00:14:19.710 --> 00:14:23.380
You're looking tired, so sleep tight, okay?

00:14:23.380 --> 00:14:26.050
Early to bed, early to rise,
eat right and stay regular!

00:14:26.050 --> 00:14:28.720
Put health first, and try hard at work.

00:14:28.720 --> 00:14:29.970
--Good fortune comes

00:14:29.970 --> 00:14:32.350
--to those who work hard!

00:14:32.350 --> 00:14:35.850
Okay, I'll be over in the next room.
Good night, Take-chan.

00:14:35.850 --> 00:14:37.430
Good night, Sana-chan.

00:14:38.350 --> 00:14:40.480
They're perfectly matched.

00:14:42.020 --> 00:14:46.440
He is her true father, after all,
so in a sense, it would only be natural.

00:14:48.030 --> 00:14:51.370
But should I tell those two?

00:14:51.370 --> 00:14:54.370
♪ What would happen if I told them? ♪

00:14:54.370 --> 00:14:57.370
--♪ If nothing would happen, ♪
--The folks in this house can't

00:14:57.370 --> 00:14:58.120
--♪ what would that make me
for telling them? ♪
--The folks in this house can't

00:14:58.120 --> 00:14:59.710
--♪ what would that make me
for telling them? ♪
--keep themselves from singing, can they?

00:14:59.710 --> 00:15:01.040
Good morning, Take-chan!

00:15:01.040 --> 00:15:02.380
Here's your breakfast!

00:15:02.380 --> 00:15:04.040
"We humbly accept this meal!"

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:07.380
Gojo-san, did you sleep well last night?

00:15:07.380 --> 00:15:08.510
Yes, Mother.

00:15:11.050 --> 00:15:14.390
Aah! A man older than me
just called me "Mother"!

00:15:14.390 --> 00:15:17.390
That takes some nerve, huh!?
Even I haven't called you that yet!

00:15:17.390 --> 00:15:19.350
That's not the issue here!

00:15:21.060 --> 00:15:22.400
Uh, Sensei?

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:24.400
Huh? Hayama's in there...

00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:25.730
You busted up the walls again!

00:15:25.770 --> 00:15:28.240
"On location!"

00:15:26.070 --> 00:15:28.400
Today's "Child's Toy" is
on location at the hospital.

00:15:28.400 --> 00:15:29.740
Sana here!

00:15:29.740 --> 00:15:31.070
Uchiyamada here!

00:15:31.070 --> 00:15:35.660
Today, we bring you a report on Zenjiro-san
visiting the doc to get a physical checkup.

00:15:35.660 --> 00:15:36.330
Woof!

00:15:36.330 --> 00:15:38.000
No, I didn't say "dog"!

00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:41.000
Oh my, Zenjiro-san has
a lot of stuff attached to him.

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:43.080
How did it all turn out?

00:15:43.080 --> 00:15:44.330
I'm the pitchuh of health.

00:15:44.330 --> 00:15:47.000
Incidentally, there are rumors that you
crashed the home of a flight attendant...

00:15:47.000 --> 00:15:48.670
...named Sayaka-san last night,
carrying a bouquet of flowers.

00:15:48.670 --> 00:15:50.670
H- h- how did you know that!?

00:15:50.670 --> 00:15:52.510
His heart rate is starting
to become irregular.

00:15:52.510 --> 00:15:54.640
There are also rumors
that you didn't get inside,

00:15:54.640 --> 00:15:57.010
and spent the night in front of her door.

00:15:57.010 --> 00:15:58.430
Oh my, it's broken.

00:15:58.430 --> 00:16:00.850
What is that thing, a lie detectuh!?

00:16:02.350 --> 00:16:05.860
What are you doing here?
You've got some nerve.

00:16:05.860 --> 00:16:07.730
--Wow, watching Sana-chan
--Zenjiro-sensei, you're too candid.

00:16:07.730 --> 00:16:09.360
--makes me feel better, too.
--Try growing up a little, okay?

00:16:09.360 --> 00:16:10.030
Cut!

00:16:10.030 --> 00:16:12.030
Hoy, we're done!

00:16:12.030 --> 00:16:14.490
Say, Take-chan, they said they
were going to do physical exams

00:16:14.490 --> 00:16:15.370
on the "Child's Toy" staff now.

00:16:15.370 --> 00:16:18.040
Why don't you have one done
while we're at it, Take-chan?

00:16:18.040 --> 00:16:20.700
Lucky me. Okay, I guess
I'll take you up on it.

00:16:22.040 --> 00:16:24.710
This week's Sana-chan.

00:16:24.710 --> 00:16:26.710
I'm in there too.

00:16:26.710 --> 00:16:29.300
Ho, Gojo-san,
you're Sana-chan's boyfriend?

00:16:29.300 --> 00:16:31.630
Doctor, if you didn't know that yet,
you're behind the times.

00:16:31.630 --> 00:16:34.890
His current address is mine.
He's staying over at my place!

00:16:34.890 --> 00:16:36.550
I don't have any other family, you see.

00:16:36.550 --> 00:16:39.220
Sana-chan has a penchant
for bringing men home with her.

00:16:39.220 --> 00:16:39.470
"This guy"

00:16:39.220 --> 00:16:40.970
Hold on, Zenjiro-san,
you make it sound disreputable!

00:16:39.720 --> 00:16:39.970
"This guy"

00:16:40.220 --> 00:16:40.470
"This guy"

00:16:40.720 --> 00:16:40.970
"This guy"

00:16:41.890 --> 00:16:45.900
Is that right? Gojo-san,
you don't have any other family, huh?

00:16:45.900 --> 00:16:48.570
Why would you ask
such a question, Doctor?

00:16:48.570 --> 00:16:52.570
Okay, we're going to take it now.
Take a deep breath.

00:16:52.570 --> 00:16:54.240
Hold it.

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:57.620
Hold it, hold it, keep holding it!
Hold it the rest of your life!

00:16:59.240 --> 00:17:00.910
He's going to die!

00:17:00.910 --> 00:17:03.250
Okay, here goes.

00:17:03.250 --> 00:17:04.250
Okay, all done.

00:17:04.250 --> 00:17:07.250
All right, you're done.
Take-chan, hurry and get dressed.

00:17:07.250 --> 00:17:07.920
Okay.

00:17:07.920 --> 00:17:09.250
Well, we're off.

00:17:09.250 --> 00:17:12.920
Oh, right. Sana-chan, the script
for "Chaos Theater" is out.

00:17:12.920 --> 00:17:13.920
Oh, really?

00:17:13.920 --> 00:17:16.260
A Sana-chan, just a minute...

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:19.260
If you don't mind,
could I get your phone number?

00:17:19.260 --> 00:17:21.270
M- my phone number?

00:17:21.270 --> 00:17:24.270
Oh-ho-ho, are you hitting on me here?

00:17:24.270 --> 00:17:27.270
You make it sound disreputable.
I just want to be friends.

00:17:27.270 --> 00:17:29.270
That's what we call "hitting on someone"!

00:17:29.270 --> 00:17:32.480
I guess I can't help that I'm
so popular with the older guys.

00:17:32.480 --> 00:17:33.900
Okay, let's keep this between you and me.

00:17:33.900 --> 00:17:35.240
--Ready?
--Ready.

00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:36.450
Okay then...

00:17:37.910 --> 00:17:40.910
--Hear that?
--Yeah, you even rattled my brain cells.

00:17:40.910 --> 00:17:42.580
Sana-chan, thanks for waiting for me.

00:17:42.580 --> 00:17:43.910
Ah, Take-chan!

00:17:43.910 --> 00:17:46.580
Bye now, Doctor! Call me
when you have time!

00:17:46.580 --> 00:17:48.960
Mm-hmm, thanks, Sana-chan.

00:17:54.260 --> 00:17:55.590
Now then...

00:17:55.590 --> 00:17:57.930
Yes, Kurata residence.

00:17:57.930 --> 00:18:01.600
Yes, Gojo Takeshi-san
is indeed staying here.

00:18:01.600 --> 00:18:06.850
As it happens, I heard that
he has no other family. As such...

00:18:08.940 --> 00:18:11.270
Oh, Take-chan, we've got more lines again!

00:18:11.270 --> 00:18:13.940
You're right. This is all
thanks to you, Sana-chan.

00:18:13.940 --> 00:18:16.610
No it's not, it's because of the
strength of your performance, Take-chan!

00:18:16.610 --> 00:18:18.660
Right? You think so too, right Rei-kun?

00:18:20.280 --> 00:18:24.290
Oh yeah, Sana-chan, today, I formally
heard about the Golden Drama.

00:18:24.290 --> 00:18:25.620
Yeah, really?

00:18:25.620 --> 00:18:27.960
That's terrific, Take-chan!
Congratulations!

00:18:27.960 --> 00:18:29.630
If Rei-kun acts as your manager, too,

00:18:29.630 --> 00:18:31.290
the work will be
coming in bang-bang, Take-chan!

00:18:31.290 --> 00:18:34.210
Y- you've got to be kidding me!
Absolutely no way!

00:18:34.210 --> 00:18:35.170
Absolutely none!

00:18:35.260 --> 00:18:36.720
"Kirishima Hospital"

00:18:38.220 --> 00:18:39.840
And there you have it.

00:18:42.550 --> 00:18:47.270
So... give it to me straight.
How much longer?

00:18:48.890 --> 00:18:51.310
I'm afraid, one month.

00:18:55.150 --> 00:18:59.150
"I'm afraid... one month...?"

00:18:55.230 --> 00:18:59.070
Uh... um, you mean... G- Gojo!?

00:18:59.240 --> 00:19:01.870
Okay! Next, it's the scene
where the eyewitness is attacked,

00:19:01.870 --> 00:19:03.580
and the criminal chases after us!

00:19:03.580 --> 00:19:05.910
This guy will be the eyewitness.

00:19:05.910 --> 00:19:06.910
Yumi, run!

00:19:06.910 --> 00:19:09.250
Dad!

00:19:09.250 --> 00:19:12.250
Take-chan, falling down
is not in the script.

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:15.590
Yeah, I tripped over my own feet. Huh?

00:19:15.590 --> 00:19:16.590
It's raining.

00:19:16.590 --> 00:19:17.920
You're right.

00:19:17.920 --> 00:19:20.590
Whew! I wonder if it's going to rain
during tomorrow's location shoot, too.

00:19:20.590 --> 00:19:22.260
Mm-hmm.

00:19:22.260 --> 00:19:25.060
But then, as long
as I'm with you, Sana-chan,

00:19:25.060 --> 00:19:27.270
it doesn't matter
what kind of weather it is.

00:19:27.270 --> 00:19:29.390
It sure doesn't, Take-chan.

00:19:33.560 --> 00:19:37.230
I kind of feel like I did
when I first started in theater.

00:19:37.230 --> 00:19:39.530
Take-chan, you're growing young again.

00:19:39.530 --> 00:19:41.200
Take that, and that!

00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:43.200
All right, one more time! Yumi, run!

00:19:43.200 --> 00:19:45.200
Aah! Dad!

00:19:45.240 --> 00:19:48.200
For crying out loud, how long is
that old guy planning on staying here?

00:19:48.200 --> 00:19:49.250
The nerve of him!

00:19:49.250 --> 00:19:52.210
I know! I'll tell him backwards!

00:19:52.210 --> 00:19:53.920
You shameless old perv!

00:19:53.920 --> 00:19:56.880
Vrep dlo sselemahs uoy!
Vrep dlo sselemahs uoy!

00:19:56.880 --> 00:19:59.550
I ought to play this right
in front of that guy!

00:19:59.550 --> 00:20:01.930
Can't you tell him directly?

00:20:01.930 --> 00:20:04.220
That's quite a racket, huh?

00:20:04.220 --> 00:20:05.600
Sensei...

00:20:05.600 --> 00:20:07.260
Sana's room, right?

00:20:07.260 --> 00:20:10.060
Sensei! Are you sure we should be
letting him stay here like this?

00:20:10.060 --> 00:20:13.100
That presumptuous fellow is liable
to take Sana-chan away from us!

00:20:13.100 --> 00:20:15.230
Please say something to him, Sensei!

00:20:15.270 --> 00:20:17.900
Let the two of them be.

00:20:17.940 --> 00:20:18.940
Sagami!

00:20:18.940 --> 00:20:19.940
Yes?

00:20:19.940 --> 00:20:23.490
What you're feeling is just petty jealousy
over having Sana taken from you.

00:20:24.910 --> 00:20:27.410
Let her create some memories

00:20:27.410 --> 00:20:29.580
with what little remaining time
the two of them have together.

00:20:29.580 --> 00:20:32.540
R- remaining time?

00:20:32.540 --> 00:20:37.540
Never mind. That man will not be staying
with us long. I can guarantee you that.

00:20:38.210 --> 00:20:41.260
Okay, if you say so, Sensei.

00:20:42.550 --> 00:20:46.550
R- right now, that's all we can do...
That's the only thing we can do.

00:20:46.550 --> 00:20:48.350
That's the only thing...

00:20:49.220 --> 00:20:52.430
What on earth has happened?

00:20:55.560 --> 00:20:57.940
The rain hasn't stopped, huh?

00:20:58.900 --> 00:21:01.570
Yo, Take-san, I heard you
accepted the Golden job.

00:21:01.570 --> 00:21:03.240
Yes, thankfully enough!

00:21:03.240 --> 00:21:05.240
Good luck. I'm looking forward to it.

00:21:05.240 --> 00:21:08.910
Right! He's Golden,
so he's going to tear it up!

00:21:08.910 --> 00:21:11.240
Well, I was thinking of
playing it more spontaneous.

00:21:11.240 --> 00:21:14.250
Right, right, right!
He's going to do that take on it!

00:21:14.250 --> 00:21:16.580
Sana-chan, you seem as thrilled
as if it were yourself, huh?

00:21:16.580 --> 00:21:19.250
That's because it's
a big step up for My Darling!

00:21:19.250 --> 00:21:21.590
Ah, I can't take listening to
any more of this, so let's get started.

00:21:21.590 --> 00:21:22.420
--Right!

00:21:22.420 --> 00:21:24.510
Ready... start!

00:21:27.260 --> 00:21:27.930
Run, Yumi!

00:21:27.930 --> 00:21:28.600
Dad!

00:21:28.600 --> 00:21:30.350
--Hurry!
--Hold it!

00:21:42.280 --> 00:21:45.610
D- Dad?

00:21:45.610 --> 00:21:46.950
Cut!

00:21:46.950 --> 00:21:49.700
Take-san, you're not
supposed to fall down there!

00:21:54.620 --> 00:21:56.620
Take-chan?

00:21:56.620 --> 00:22:01.630
Take-chan? Take-chan?
Take-chan, get up. Take-chan!

00:22:01.630 --> 00:22:04.170
Take-chan! Take-chan! Take-chan!

00:22:08.640 --> 00:22:10.300
T- Take-chan!

00:22:11.970 --> 00:22:16.890
Take-chan!

00:22:18.650 --> 00:22:22.400
Take-chan!

00:22:23.650 --> 00:22:28.660
Take-chan... you ate right and everything...

00:22:28.660 --> 00:22:32.530
You ate right and everything...

00:22:36.790 --> 00:22:39.080
It's all DAIJO-BU DAIJO-BU

00:22:39.120 --> 00:22:41.840
When you sing this song, your worries will go

00:22:42.000 --> 00:22:43.960
Bye Bye Bye

00:22:44.300 --> 00:22:46.630
Cuz your heart will be carefree,

00:22:46.800 --> 00:22:48.590
and your body will be healthy,

00:22:48.680 --> 00:22:50.430
so resolve when to give up

00:22:50.640 --> 00:22:52.430
Bye Bye Bye Bye

00:22:52.430 --> 00:22:53.760
(Sing-ken-ken ken-ken)

00:22:53.760 --> 00:22:55.430
(Tidak apa-apa,
Nday kambay kambay)

00:22:55.600 --> 00:22:58.060
It's always the same old nonsense,

00:22:58.180 --> 00:23:00.520
U-MAI U-MAI U-MAI U-MAI U-MAI

00:23:00.560 --> 00:23:03.060
(Mm? Could be you're fairly dumb...)

00:23:03.110 --> 00:23:05.730
and then later comes the whimpering,

00:23:05.860 --> 00:23:07.570
KU-RAI KU-RAI KU-RAI KU-RAI KU-RAI

00:23:08.320 --> 00:23:11.030
(Ah... it's fine, it's fine, it's fine)

00:23:11.030 --> 00:23:13.330
It's all crazy over there,

00:23:13.490 --> 00:23:15.240
it's all "waah!" over here,

00:23:15.370 --> 00:23:18.580
and the whole Earth
is spinning the wrong way.

00:23:18.710 --> 00:23:22.420
So at this point now, yeah at this point now,

00:23:22.540 --> 00:23:26.710
you can laugh it away, excuse me, I must be going.

00:23:26.760 --> 00:23:28.630
DAIJO-BU DAIJO-BU

00:23:28.760 --> 00:23:31.470
When you sing this song, your worries will go

00:23:31.590 --> 00:23:33.390
Bye Bye Bye

00:23:33.760 --> 00:23:36.260
Cuz you tried your MECHA-KUCHA best,

00:23:36.390 --> 00:23:38.140
to PECHA-KUCHA out a "Hi,"

00:23:38.270 --> 00:23:40.100
so just keep going unlike this!

00:23:40.230 --> 00:23:42.020
Wai Wai Wai Wai

00:23:42.150 --> 00:23:43.900
DAIJO-BU DAIJO-BU

00:23:44.020 --> 00:23:46.730
Once your lips touch, you can't change your mind.

00:23:49.240 --> 00:23:51.490
Cuz your heart will be carefree,

00:23:51.660 --> 00:23:53.410
and your body will be healthy,

00:23:53.530 --> 00:23:55.330
so resolve when to give up

00:23:55.450 --> 00:23:58.910
Bye Bye Bye Bye

00:23:58.950 --> 00:24:01.120
(Sing-ken-ken ken-ken,
Tidak apa-apa)

00:24:01.210 --> 00:24:03.120
(Gwaenchansseumnida,
kwenchanayo)

00:24:03.210 --> 00:24:04.500
(Mou man tail)

00:24:11.130 --> 00:24:12.590
I'm so glad...

00:24:14.430 --> 00:24:15.970
...I met you...

00:24:17.180 --> 00:24:19.640
No... not yet...

00:24:20.680 --> 00:24:23.980
No... Take-chan...

00:24:25.690 --> 00:24:29.820
Not yet! You can't die yet!

00:24:31.440 --> 00:24:37.280
"This Is Our Last Scene Together"
